    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Exceptional Duplex Apartment Situated In A Hugely Attractive Mature Landscaped Courtyard Available To Let \r\nFerndale Court occupies a really attractive location close to the charming small village of Old Connaught 2 kilometres north of Bray.  All amenities and services are thus available nearby and the City Centre is just 18 kilometres away and the N11/M50 is only five minutes away.  Number 26 is presented in immaculate condition.  Enjoying a southerly aspect the owners enjoy peerless views wheat fields to a remarkable panorama that has the Irish Sea to the east, then Bray Head, Sugarloaf Great and the outline of the Wicklow Mountains to the west. \r\nFeatures include Electric Storage Heaters & Convector Heaters, Electric Fire Alarm in Each Room, Electric Security Gates and Accommodation Extending to 1,220 sq.ft./113 square metres. Comprising entrance hallway with guest wc, lounge/dining room, fully fitted kitchen breakfast room and 2 bedrooms both ensuite.\r\nRent: €2400 per month available now"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
